d but maybe parser repairs. We can replace the whole huge name with `/AAAA` and then a comment to preserve length, but earlier that didn't call? Wait we tried that with poc_exploit2 and patch script; but maybe the embedded font was not forced to fail. Let's make poc_exploit4 (stream zeroed) and replace name with `/AAAA` plus comment to preserve length."}],"encrypted_content":null}}
